      "en": "A free interactive Kindergarten activity for position words: help Beaver Bramble park each vehicle above, below, next to, or between the others in his side-on parking tower. The floor between levels makes \"above\" mean one level up, so children must listen to the word — not just guess the nearest spot. Describing relative positions is the heart of Common Core K.G.A.1.",
